  "description": "复刻 tools/fish/states_shop.go:33-59 buyBaitFlow + handleBuyBait. 流程: waitLong(2s) → tap(r) → waitLong(2s) → ClickTemplate(bait_product, 5s) → waitDur(1s) → ClickTemplate(buy_max, 5s) → waitDur(1s) → ClickTemplate(buy_button, 5s) → waitDur(1s) → ClickTemplate(buy_confirm, 5s, missSkip) → waitDur(1s) → clickUntilGone(buy_success, 3 iter × 800ms) → tapUntilGone(esc, buy_max, 4 iter × 1s) → state=CHANGEBAIT. 任一 ClickTemplate(bait_product/buy_max/buy_button) timeout → state=RECOVERING (missFailPause). v2 简化: (a) 跳过 abortIfNoCurrency() — 不复刻 AutoSell pause / buyBaitAfterSell / buyBaitAbortIdle 串联, OnDone 固定 CHANGEBAIT (跟 fish bot 一致, 不复刻 dispatcher 改派); (b) buy_confirm missSkip — done 和 timeout 都接到下一步 Sleep, 钱不够 <99 时不弹也照常走; (c) clickUntilGone(buy_success) 简化为 Loop count=3 + ClickTemplate(timeoutMs=2000) — done 算一次点击 + Sleep 800ms continue, timeout 算 toast 消失 Break. 调用方义务: container 顶层声明 state: string default IDLE.",
